   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert DG DEVCO/A1 Policy Coherence for Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert till DG DEVCO i Bryssel p&#xe5; EU-delegationen.

Det nationella expertprogrammet v&#xe4;nder sig till experter p&#xe5; bist&#xe5;ndsfr&#xe5;gor anst&#xe4;llda p&#xe5; Sida och UD. NE kan vara anst&#xe4;llda i Bryssel eller p&#xe5; EU Delegation i max 4 &#xe5;r.Huvudsysftet &#xe4;r kunskapsutbyte och att f&#xe5; in fler svenskar i EU.
F&#xf6;r n&#xe4;rmare beskrivning av denna insats se bifogad Terms of Reference f&#xf6;r NE-tj&#xe4;nsten ifr&#xe5;ga.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Experts Program is directed to experts in development  cooperation issues employed by Sida and MFA. They work as NE for a    maximum of 4  years in Brussels or in a EU Delegation. The main goal  with the Program is exchange of knowledge, to have more Swedes        working within the EU and thus have a greater impact on EU            development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
